  "title": "Broiled Short Ribs",
  "description": "Short ribs boiled, then broiled and basted with a molasses, mustard and ketchup sauce. Boiling the ribs first makes them so tender and gets rid of a lot of the fat.",
  "authors": [
    "Donna"
  ],
